    <statement><p>Consider the ellipsoid <m>x^{2}+4y^{2}+z^{2} = 21</m>.</p>
<p>The implicit form of the tangent plane to this ellipsoid at
<m>\left(-1,2,-2\right)</m> is <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
<p>The parametric form of the line through this point that is
perpendicular to that tangent plane is <m>L(t)</m> = <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>8y-x-2z = 21</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(-1,2,-2\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;-1,8,-2\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
